config MODELOS_POLL_NET
 bool "ModelOS owner-polled virtio PCI network rings"
 depends on MODELOS_KERNEL_ONLY && PCI && !VIRTIO_NET
 help
   Fixed boot-time DMA rings and frame buffers, polled by the service owner.
   Does not depend on NET, INET, virtio queues, NAPI, skb or interrupt handlers.
   The service links its existing small TCP library separately.
